OL,3,GNEWSACalls for MPs to focus on Clean
OL,4,AWater Bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have gathered on a beach to
OL,7,Fprotest about water quality.
OL,9,FSurfers Against Sewage said that in
OL,10,F2025 Exmouth's sea was affected by
OL,11,Fsewage pollution for 111 days and to
OL,12,Freflect that campaigners brought 111
OL,13,Fgiant poo shaped cut-outs to the
OL,14,Fprotest on Sunday.
OL,16,FNicky Nicholls, community lead at
OL,17,FSideshore hub in Exmouth, Devon, said:
OL,18,F"All around the country people are
OL,19,Fcalling on their MPs to focus on the
OL,20,FClean Water Bill that is going through
OL,21,FParliament."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
