OL,3,GNEWSACalls for MPs to focus on Clean
OL,4,AWater Bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said there was "more
OL,7,Fto do but the direction is clear -
OL,8,Ffewer spills, shorter duration and
OL,9,Finvestment where it matters most". It
OL,10,Fsaid it respected its customers. The
OL,11,Fgovernment said the bill would deliver
OL,12,Fcleaner waters.
